    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 49.8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 49.8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hie ða on monegum senoðum monegra menniscra misdæda bote gesetton, ⁊ on monega senoðbéc hie writan, hwær anne dom hwær oþerne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Then they established in many synods the remedies for the various misdeeds of men, and they wrote in many books of synodal decrees, in one place one judgment and in one place another.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hy ða on monigum senoþum monegra menniscra misdæda bote gesetton, ond on monegra senoþbec hy writon, hwær ænne dóm hwær oþerne.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
